Subject: Prepare known graphics pipelines before original game entry
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Expose coherent startup preparation status and request known configurations for
current render targets using the existing compiler worker. Readiness includes
queued work, active compilation and final publication/cache maintenance. Set
cache-prune readiness before scheduling, so a hot worker cannot finish before
the flag is armed. Record demanded cache hits, misses and miss-resolution time.
Preserve draw ordering, first-use blocking, rendering and original game logic.

